{
  "dom_id": "step-e12970",
  "name": "Example: Solving Linear Inequalities With Variables on Both Sides",
  "problem": "Solve the inequality $5x+13 \\ge 3x-7$ and sketch the solution on the number line.",
  "worked_solution": "We solve the inequality just like we would solve an equation.\n\nFirst, we apply the addition principle:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x+13 & \\ge 3x-7 \\\\ 5x+13-3x & \\ge 3x-7-3x \\\\ 2x+13 & \\ge -7 \\\\ 2x+13-13 & \\ge -7-13 \\\\ 2x & \\ge -20\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we use the multiplication principle:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x & \\ge -20 \\\\ \\frac{2x}{2} & \\ge \\frac{-20}{2} \\\\ x & \\ge -10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x \\ge -10.$\n\nOur solution can be expressed using a number line, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14192942/assets/04b9a164fbff3b0603dcbd2b3283ad44ba480af91ae9af3dbd4ddcfe086c0752.png)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e12970\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Solving Linear Inequalities With Variables on Both Sides</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e12970\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n      